- QUEST_BOXES adds the 4 keys: the 2 fronts `logo-tile` {19, 12, 172, 54}, the 2 backs `logo-tile`
  {19, 7, 172, 36}. Every other box is unchanged.
- `logoTile(kind, bleedMm)` draws the amber tile with the brown 0.6 mm border, the 3 mm radius, and
