- `frontBody` and `backBody` take the top style. With hlogo the front holds the art, the tile, the
  teacher band pill, and the title plaque. The back holds the art, the tile, the student panel, the
  contact sign, the contact lines, the publisher mark, the QR, and the LINE label. The default path
  builds the same strings in the same order, so A2 holds the 4 r5 pins byte for byte, and A5 holds
  every kept part byte for byte.
- BUILD: `--top` is a value flag with the values banner and hlogo, the default is banner, and any
